    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Adventures of DaKoo the Dragon\u00ae is a classic platformer that focuses heavily on replayability. It takes inspiration and pays homage to the classic games of old using a hand drawn art style. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play as the mighty DaKoo, a dragon with incredible powers and an insatiable thirst for adventure. Players embark on a series of daring quests, each one more challenging than the last. From battling numerous baddies to exploring vast environments, there is no shortage of excitement! What sets Adventures of DaKoo the Dragon apart from other games is its incredible attention to detail. The world of the game is richly imagined, with stunning visuals and intricate level designs that make every moment feel like a true adventure. As players progress through the game, they will encounter a wide variety of enemies, each with their own unique strengths and weaknesses. Players will need to use all of their wits and cunning to emerge victorious. But it\u2019s not just about combat. Along the way, players will also need to solve puzzles to gather resources! Every interaction feels meaningful and engaging. An unforgettable gaming experience for all ages!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2011440/extras/98516bf28ec9c4fbcf9d69622f11f200.poster.avif?t=1734622771\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2011440/extras/98516bf28ec9c4fbcf9d69622f11f200.webm?t=1734622771\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2011440/extras/98516bf28ec9c4fbcf9d69622f11f200.mp4?t=1734622771\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use rocket ships to take on the enemy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2011440/extras/4426371f078bab642289f0400f17f33f.avif?t=1734622771\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use attacks on the ground or in the air to defend or attack enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2011440/extras/e40fcc859be3173423c36f874b121d74.avif?t=1734622771\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use Fireballs to defend or attack enemies and bosses!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2011440/extras/a3e57b4f65c37573615b7fa9af487dcf.avif?t=1734622771\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Navigate vortex levels through gravity zones using 90 and 180 degree turns! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2011440/extras/f2df8060623225edfe8a68ee1c326a9b.avif?t=1734622771\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use jump combos to take on multiple enemies at the same time and destroy enemy factories!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2011440/extras/c606b817d1fcb90df05d38179fb2d9d7.avif?t=1734622771\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use 5 different shields to defend yourself all while traversing through 5 different environments plus multiple Vortex levels!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Adventures of DaKoo the Dragon\u00ae is a classic platformer that focuses heavily on replayability. It takes inspiration and pays homage to the classic games of old using a hand drawn art style. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play as the mighty DaKoo, a dragon with incredible powers and an insatiable thirst for adventure. Players embark on a series of daring quests, each one more challenging than the last. From battling numerous baddies to exploring vast environments, there is no shortage of excitement! What sets Adventures of DaKoo the Dragon apart from other games is its incredible attention to detail. The world of the game is richly imagined, with stunning visuals and intricate level designs that make every moment feel like a true adventure. As players progress through the game, they will encounter a wide variety of enemies, each with their own unique strengths and weaknesses. Players will need to use all of their wits and cunning to emerge victorious. But it\u2019s not just about combat. Along the way, players will also need to solve puzzles to gather resources! Every interaction feels meaningful and engaging. An unforgettable gaming experience for all ages!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2011440/extras/98516bf28ec9c4fbcf9d69622f11f200.poster.avif?t=1734622771\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2011440/extras/98516bf28ec9c4fbcf9d69622f11f200.webm?t=1734622771\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2011440/extras/98516bf28ec9c4fbcf9d69622f11f200.mp4?t=1734622771\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use rocket ships to take o